835-// --- World-scoped snapshot store ------------------------------------------------------
836-//
837-// Deliberately here, in the PURE module, and not in the director.
838-//
839-// `persistence.ts` needs to read and write this at the WorldSave boundary, and
840-// the director imports `storyState.ts`, which imports `persistence.ts`. Putting
841-// the store beside the reducers keeps that cycle from existing at all, and it
842-// mirrors exactly how the Habitat Core's world-keyed truth is already reached.
